    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Az 1989-90- es fordulat minden posztkommunista orsz\u00e1gban eljutott od\u00e1ig, hogy a kommunista vezet\u0151ket utol\u00e9rte a sz\u00e1monk\u00e9r\u00e9s. Ceausescu, Jaruzelski, Honecker, Krentz \u00e9s t\u00e1rsaik. Egy kiv\u00e9tel\u00e9vel: Magyarorsz\u00e1g. K\u00e1d\u00e1r J\u00e1nost\u00f3l \u00e9s elvt\u00e1rsait\u00f3l senki sem k\u00e9rte sz\u00e1mon regn\u00e1l\u00e1sa alatt elk\u00f6vetett b\u0171n\u00fcket \u00e9s senki sem hallgatta meg v\u00e9lt, vagy val\u00f3s ments\u00e9geit. A k\u00e1d\u00e1r.kom c\u00e9lja, hogy \u00e9rtelmezhet\u0151 \u00e9s val\u00f3s k\u00e9pet adjon K\u00e1d\u00e1r J\u00e1nosr\u00f3l. Arra keresi a v\u00e1laszt, hogy K\u00e1d\u00e1r milyen k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9nyek k\u00f6z\u00f6tt jutott a hatalom k\u00f6zel\u00e9be, ker\u00fclt hatalomra, hogy nev\u00e9vel f\u00e9mjelzett rendszer mit adott Magyarorsz\u00e1gnak, \u00e9s mit vett el az orsz\u00e1gt\u00f3l. A filmben is k\u00f6zrem\u0171k\u00f6d\u0151 Dr. Berecz J\u00e1nos az egyetlen, aki val\u00f3ban \"dolgozott egy\u00fctt\" K\u00e1d\u00e1rral a megsz\u00f3lal\u00f3k k\u00f6z\u00fcl, ugyanis \u0151 MSZMP KB tagja, az \u00e1llamp\u00e1rt ideol\u00f3giai \u00e9s propaganda\u00fcgyekkel foglalkoz\u00f3 KB-titk\u00e1ra, ekkoriban egyik legbefoly\u00e1sosabb politikusa, 1987-ben a Politikai Bizotts\u00e1g tagja volt. 1982-ben t\u00e1vozott az MSZMP KB k\u00fcl\u00fcgyi oszt\u00e1lya \u00e9l\u00e9r\u0151l, \u00e9s a N\u00e9pszabads\u00e1g f\u0151szerkeszt\u0151je lett.",
        "english": "After the regime change of 1989-90, every post-communist country got to the point, when the communist leaders were caught up by accountability. Ceausescu, Jaruzelski, Honecker, Krentz and their comrades. With one exception: Hungary. K\u00e1d\u00e1r J\u00e1nos and his comrades were not held accountable for those crimes committed during his reign and nobody listened to his false or true excuses. The aim of K\u00e1d\u00e1r.kom is to provide an interpretable and real image about K\u00e1d\u00e1r J\u00e1nos. It is looking for the answer in what circumstances K\u00e1d\u00e1r came near to power, rose to power, what his regime gave to Hungary and what it took away from the country."
    },
